# 2026-05-03 21:22:43.477066
+The file is missing these four security headers that were removed accidentally. Add them back after the Content-Security-Policy header is set, before the return $response; line:
+php$response->headers->set('X-Frame-Options', 'DENY');
+$response->headers->set('X-Content-Type-Options', 'nosniff');
+$response->headers->set('Strict-Transport-Security', 'max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains');
+$response->headers->set('Referrer-Policy', 'no-referrer');
+Also restore declare(strict_types=1); at the top of the file after <?php if it was removed. Do not change anything else."

# 2026-05-03 21:28:40.719331
+"In the $viteDevSources variable, remove all the http://[::1]:5173, http://[::1]:5194, ws://[::1]:5173, and ws://[::1]:5194 entries. Keep only http://localhost:5173, http://localhost:5194, ws://localhost:5173, ws://localhost:5194. The IPv6 format is not valid in CSP headers."

